  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now diving into the UI components, focusing on translating the design and implementing the UAT scenarios. I\'m aiming for pixel-perfect accuracy with the given design and ensuring that all five UAT scenarios are addressed in the UI build. My goal is a faithful rendition of the provided specifications for these components.\n\n\n**Defining Component Specifications**\n\nI\'ve moved on to defining the specifications for the UI components. Specifically, I\'m fleshing out the requirements for the `ScooterSilhouette.tsx` component, including the precise vector illustrations needed to match the design. I\'m also planning the interactive console, `UatControlConsole.tsx`, to facilitate testing of UAT scenarios and the stock synchronization functionality.\n\n\n**Implementing Interactive Booking**\n\nI\'m now integrating live Telegram Bot notifications for bookings, with interactive approval buttons. These buttons will manage license plate locks, courier dispatches, and E-receipt pushes. I\'m also adding a 15-minute client duplication feature to `siteConfig.ts` with brand name and WhatsApp number editing, along with an export option. Finally, I\'m working on `/components/BookingWizardApp.tsx` and incorporating a toggle for split/responsive views, or a 3-screen side-by-side mobile board view.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2210195"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"\'use client\';\\n\\nimport React from \'react\';\\n\\ninterface ScooterSilhouetteProps {\\n  variant?: \'nmax\' | \'pcx\' | \'scoopy\' | \'vario\' | \'fazzio\';\\n  size?: \'lg\' | \'sm\';\\n  dimmed?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport function ScooterSilhouette({\\n  variant = \'nmax\',\\n  size = \'lg\',\\n  dimmed = false,\\n}: ScooterSilhouetteProps) {\\n  const strokeColor = dimmed ? \'rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35)\' : \'#FFFFFF\';\\n  const accentStroke = dimmed ? \'rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2)\' : \'rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.85)\';\\n\\n  if (size === \'sm\') {\\n    return (\\n      <div className=\\\"relative w-full h-14 flex items-center justify-center select-none pointer-events-none\\\">\\n        <svg\\n          viewBox=\\\"0 0 120 68\\\"\\n          className=\\\"w-24 h-14 overflow-visible\\\"\\n          fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n          xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"\\n        >\\n          {/* Rear & Front Wheels */}\\n          <circle cx=\\\"26\\\" cy=\\\"48\\\" r=\\\"11\\\" stroke={strokeColor} strokeWidth=\\\"2.5\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"92\\\" cy=\\\"48\\\" r=\\\"11\\\" stroke={strokeColor} strokeWidth=\\\"2.5\\\" />\\n          {/* Scooter Body Chassis */}\\n          {variant === \'scoopy\' || variant === \'fazzio\' ? (\\n            <path\\n              d=\\\"M16 44 C16 32, 34 30, 48 30 L56 44 L78 44 L84 22 L72 20 M84 22 L92 48\\\"\\n              stroke={strokeColor}\\n              strokeWidth=\\\"2.4\\\"\\n              strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n              strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n            />\\n          ) : (\\n            <path\\n              d=\\\"M15 42 L30 28 L52 30 L60 44 L80 42 L86 20 L74 18 M86 20 L92 48\\\"\\n              stroke={strokeColor}\\n              strokeWidth=\\\"2.4\\\"\\n              strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n              strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n            />\\n          )}\\n          {/* Seat */}\\n          <path\\n            d=\\\"M28 28 Q42 26 52 30\\\"\\n            stroke={accentStroke}\\n            strokeWidth=\\\"3\\\"\\n            strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n          />\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"relative w-full h-36 flex items-center justify-center select-none pointer-events-none\\\">\\n      {/* Radial ambient glow under the featured scooter */}\\n      {!dimmed && (\\n        <div\\n          className=\\\"absolute inset-x-8 top-4 bottom-2 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-50\\\"\\n          style={{\\n            background:\\n              \'radial-gradient(circle, rgba(96,165,250,0.55) 0%, rgba(37,99,235,0.2) 60%, transparent 100%)\',\\n          }}\\n        />\\n      )}\\n      <svg\\n        viewBox=\\\"0 0 260 130\\\"\\n        className=\\\"relative z-10 w-56 h-32 overflow-visible drop-shadow-[0_8px_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.35)]\\\"\\n        fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n        xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"\\n      >\\n        {/* Rear Wheel */}\\n        <circle cx=\\\"58\\\" cy=\\\"94\\\" r=\\\"22\\\" stroke={strokeColor} strokeWidth=\\\"4\\\" />\\n        <circle cx=\\\"58\\\" cy=\\\"94\\\" r=\\\"9\\\" stroke={accentStroke} strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\" />\\n        {/* Front Wheel */}\\n        <circle cx=\\\"198\\\" cy=\\\"94\\\" r=\\\"22\\\" stroke={strokeColor} strokeWidth=\\\"4\\\" />\\n        <circle cx=\\\"198\\\" cy=\\\"94\\\" r=\\\"9\\\" stroke={accentStroke} strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\" />\\n\\n        {/* Maxi Scooter Touring Silhouette (NMAX / PCX) */}\\n        <path\\n          d=\\\"M36 82 C42 62, 66 56, 108 58 L126 86 L168 86 L186 38 L158 34\\\"\\n          stroke={strokeColor}\\n          strokeWidth=\\\"4\\\"\\n          strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n          strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n        />\\n        {/* Front Fork & Fairing */}\\n        <path\\n          d=\\\"M182 46 L198 94\\\"\\n          stroke={strokeColor}\\n          strokeWidth=\\\"4\\\"\\n          strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n        />\\n        {/* Touring Windshield & Seat Contour */}\\n        <path\\n          d=\\\"M174 24 C184 30, 192 42, 195 54\\\"\\n          stroke={accentStroke}\\n          strokeWidth=\\\"3\\\"\\n          strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n        />\\n        <path\\n          d=\\\"M54 54 C74 50, 96 52, 112 58\\\"\\n          stroke={accentStroke}\\n          strokeWidth=\\\"4.5\\\"\\n          strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n        />\\n        {/* Lower Footboard & Exhaust Line */}\\n        <path\\n          d=\\\"M58 94 L156 92\\\"\\n          stroke={accentStroke}\\n          strokeWidth=\\\"2.5\\\"\\n          strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n          strokeDasharray=\\\"6 6\\\"\\n        />\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create ScooterSilhouette vector graphic component matching the UI/UX SVG design\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/components/ScooterSilhouette.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating ScooterSilhouette component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create components/ScooterSilhouette.tsx\"}"
